<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on UBS bearer shares.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on UBS bearer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston, Zurich said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on UBS bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1650 CHF		  PREMIUM	13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.85 CHF		  GEARING	11 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.JUN.97-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	09.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1572 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
